        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find My Frogs</strong> is a cozy hidden object game where you search for frogs and toads in a peaceful, hand-drawn village. Explore charming spots, uncover secrets, and help Uncle Froger gather everyone for a family photo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ <strong>Explore</strong> the hand-drawn world of Moss Glade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐸 <strong>Find</strong> 350+ Frogs and Toads</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔍 <strong>Discover</strong> 60+ hidden secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌙 <strong>Choose</strong> between day or night, or let time flow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ <strong>Relax</strong> in a soothing atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With calming animations and sounds, soothing music, and playful interactions - such as helping a little frog pick strawberries - <strong>Find My Frogs</strong> offers a sweet moment of serenity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Find My Frogs is a passion project by a duo of artists.</i></p>",
